2026-11-16T21:52:40.6205016Z       ],
2026-11-16T21:52:40.6205330Z       "source": "    def forward(self, x):\n        shp = x.shape\n        x = x.view(*shp[:-1], -1, self.dim)\n        x = F.softmax(x, dim=-1)\n        return x.view(*shp)"
