2026-11-16T21:52:40.6267569Z       "source": "    def forward(self, x):\n        if x.ndim > 4:\n            batch_shape = x.shape[:-3]\n            out = self.conv(x.view(-1, *x.shape[-3:]))\n            out = out.view(*batch_shape, *out.shape[1:])\n        else:\n            out = self.conv(x)\n        return out"
